Error [E0201]: `s` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/move_from_borrowed_argument.jet:25:14
    |
 25 |     consume(^s)
    |              ^
 Why: `s` is a read or write parameter, so its caller keeps the value; moving it here would copy it
 Fix: Write `s.copy()` when `consume` should receive a copy, or declare the parameter `^` so the caller hands the value over
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201

