Error [E0201]: `view` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/move_from_borrowed_argument.jet:34:14
    |
 34 |     consume(^view)
    |              ^^^^
 Why: `view` reads its value through a view of the place it was bound to, so that place keeps the value; moving it here would copy it
 Fix: Write `view.copy()` when `consume` should receive a copy, or move the place itself with `^` when this scope owns it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201

